dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				By <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/junior/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/5477daf144b773756f414abb08c7f19f17067ab03bd10f6dd6da28134637880f?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/5477daf144b773756f414abb08c7f19f17067ab03bd10f6dd6da28134637880f?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/junior/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">Lee <small>(junior)</small></a> on <span class=\"review-date\">March 13, 2025</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I use WooCommerce on my personal site and it works perfectly for my needs. Support is fantastic as well. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Highly recommend you give it a try.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Best Ecommerce Plugin</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				By <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/saqibsiddiqui85/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/bd3c6e9111ecf2e61c6694cac35cb94c8e3f2b8a6410cc943cc3630d85f1e54f?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/bd3c6e9111ecf2e61c6694cac35cb94c8e3f2b8a6410cc943cc3630d85f1e54f?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/saqibsiddiqui85/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">saqibsiddiqui85</a> on <span class=\"review-date\">March 6, 2025</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Best of all available eCommerce solution in the market.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Great plugin</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				By <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/dragondefeu76/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/4cc33828b99dcfe01e66b51ed882033ffd813bd64026d9a8eb16deaa289533a8?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/4cc33828b99dcfe01e66b51ed882033ffd813bd64026d9a8eb16deaa289533a8?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/dragondefeu76/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">dragondefeu76</a> on <span class=\"review-date\">February 27, 2025</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The essential for a great store! And great support !</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">currency feature</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"4 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"4\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				By <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/shahinsheikh/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d53939faa54b5bf9d5902f9a54007a46cc83ad8fb7f906b7235258fda012d7d0?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d53939faa54b5bf9d5902f9a54007a46cc83ad8fb7f906b7235258fda012d7d0?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/shahinsheikh/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">shahinsheikh</a> on <span class=\"review-date\">February 25, 2025</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>should have AED currency to use for UAE sites. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">The best scalable ecommerce platform.</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				By <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/adminalje/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ba85f7e059cd9add48fe5c5ff6b811abedf0ad6d9f0fac722b654373e68fedc9?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/ba85f7e059cd9add48fe5c5ff6b811abedf0ad6d9f0fac722b654373e68fedc9?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/adminalje/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">Alje Ybanez <small>(adminalje)</small></a> on <span class=\"review-date\">February 23, 2025</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>been using WooCommerce since 2019.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Email not working Junk</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"1 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"1\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				By <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/hayden1917/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/8341546ce99ddc55c745128349db9c6e3be6f9b93459bf624e0d99adab271d86?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/8341546ce99ddc55c745128349db9c6e3be6f9b93459bf624e0d99adab271d86?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/hayden1917/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">hayden1917</a> on <span class=\"review-date\">February 21, 2025</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Email not working Junk</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">10 years of happy usage!</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				By <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/lindam415/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a088e5938e8f903dc12e93b6a8076c715505cf593c55730034c94d6ff76d6fcb?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a088e5938e8f903dc12e93b6a8076c715505cf593c55730034c94d6ff76d6fcb?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/lindam415/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">lindam415</a> on <span class=\"review-date\">February 12, 2025</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>My first WooCommerce store was started 10+ years ago, since then I\'ve started many store, and overall it works great, also it\'s totally free which is pretty amazing really.<br /><br />Thank you</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">FIX THIS PLEASE</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"1 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"1\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				By <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/transmission2day/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/7549b4d50c98396bbbb4839036d9e8ed5ba783426f5b0fe799db3c1d02a1a9ca?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/7549b4d50c98396bbbb4839036d9e8ed5ba783426f5b0fe799db3c1d02a1a9ca?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/transmission2day/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">TRM2DAY <small>(transmission2day)</small></a> on <span class=\"review-date\">February 10, 2025</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>the <strong>left-aligned settings issue</strong> in WooCommerce\'s admin panel has been a long-standing design quirk that frustrates many users. The overly left-aligned text and cramped layout in the settings area can make navigating options feel cluttered and less user-friendly—especially when working on smaller screens or with a lot of menu items.<br /><br />concerns about WooCommerce\'s integration with WordPress and the checkout page experience, such as the cumbersome country dropdown, are valid and shared by many users. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">DOES WORK AFTER UPDATE</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"1 out of 5 stars\" data-title-template=\"%s out of 5 stars\" data-rating=\"1\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				By <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/magones/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2f491ac6e30fa7e68f8bf1af122f03f386c22ca4f2a3f6e399c8f837ed8939a8?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2f491ac6e30fa7e68f8bf1af122f03f386c22ca4f2a3f6e399c8f837ed8939a8?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/magones/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">magones</a> on <span class=\"review-date\">February 6, 2025</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>WooCommerce decided to release an update, and now nothing works. Emails aren\'t being sent, even though everything is set up as usual. I\'ve tried fixing it with AI assistance, but without success. Even WS Forms suddenly stopped working, even though everything was fine before. Hope you working on this</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n\";}s:17:\"short_description\";s:146:\"Everything you need to launch an online store in days and keep it growing for years. From your first sale to millions in revenue, Woo is with you.\";s:13:\"download_link\";s:60:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/woocommerce.9.7.1.zip\";s:14:\"upgrade_notice\";a:0:{}s:11:\"screenshots\";a:6:{i:1;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:64:\"https://ps.w.org/woocommerce/assets/screenshot-1.png?rev=3234504\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:64:\"https://ps.w.org/woocommerce/assets/screenshot-2.png?rev=3234504\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:64:\"https://ps.w.org/woocommerce/assets/screenshot-3.png?rev=3234504\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";}i:4;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:64:\"https://ps.w.org/woocommerce/assets/screenshot-4.png?rev=3235205\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";}i:5;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:64:\"https://ps.w.org/woocommerce/assets/screenshot-5.png?rev=3234504\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";}i:6;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:64:\"https://ps.w.org/woocommerce/assets/screenshot-6.png?rev=3234504\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"tags\";a:5:{s:9:\"ecommerce\";s:9:\"ecommerce\";s:12:\"online-store\";s:12:\"online store\";s:11:\"sell-online\";s:11:\"sell online\";s:4:\"shop\";s:4:\"shop\";s:13:\"shopping-cart\";s:13:\"shopping cart\";}s:8:\"versions\";a:477:{s:5:\"3.0.0\";s:60:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/woocommerce.3.0.0.zip\";s:5:\"3.0.1\";s:60:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/woocommerce.3.0.1.zip\";s:5:\"3.0.2\";s:60:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/woocommerce.3.0.2.zip\";s:5:\"3.0.3\";s:60:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/woocommerce.3.0.3.zip\";s:5:\"3.0.4\";s:60:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/woocommerce.3.0.4.zip\";s:5:\"3.0.5\";s:60:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/woocomme