tings\":{\"title\":\"Lovor vi\\u0161nja\",\"__dynamic__\":[],\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"\",\"title_color\":\"\"},\"raw_id\":\"el_title_uc_2\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Allan\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":30,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_size_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":32,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":1.2,\"sizes\":[]},\"header_size\":\"h3\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"c7fe0ed\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":35,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"},{\"id\":\"100b16f\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Jedna od najpoznatiji \\u017eivih ograda koja se trenutno uzgaja u Srbiji. Retko se mo\\u017ee prona\\u0107i u prirodi kao samonikla. Vodi poreklo iz isto\\u010dne Evrope i zapadne Azije, \\u0161to negde i obja\\u0161njava njenu laku prilagodljivost razli\\u010diti klimatskim uslovima, od kontinentalne do sredozemne (mediteranske) klime. U prirodi i samonikla se mo\\u017ee na\\u0107i u Bugarskoj, Iranu i na Kavkazu. Ova biljke je veoma rasprostranjena u urbanim sredinama te je postala jedan od vode\\u0107ih trendova u uzgoju \\u017eivih ograda u poslednjih 20-ak godina.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"left\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"\"},\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"raw_id\":\"el_content_1\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Inter\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":15,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_text_transform\":\"none\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":1.6,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"cbd84e3\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":40,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"},{\"id\":\"f1ac105\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"icon_boxes_items\":[{\"title_text\":\"Sunce\",\"description_text\":\"\",\"button_text\":\"\",\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/wordpress\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/12\\/checkbox-circle-fill.svg\",\"id\":8080},\"library\":\"svg\"},\"_id\":\"2067ab0\"},{\"title_text\":\"Polusenka\",\"description_text\":\"\",\"button_text\":\"\",\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/wordpress\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/12\\/checkbox-circle-fill.svg\",\"id\":8080},\"library\":\"svg\"},\"_id\":\"5c04df1\"},{\"title_text\":\"3-5 m\",\"description_text\":\"\",\"button_text\":\"\",\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/wordpress\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/12\\/checkbox-circle-fill.svg\",\"id\":8080},\"library\":\"svg\"},\"_id\":\"646f623\"},{\"title_text\":\"Zimzeleno\",\"description_text\":\"\",\"button_text\":\"\",\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/wordpress\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/12\\/checkbox-circle-fill.svg\",\"id\":8080},\"library\":\"svg\"},\"_id\":\"c1326b0\"},{\"title_text\":\"Sadnice veli\\u010dine 10-15 cm\",\"description_text\":\"\",\"button_text\":\"\",\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/wordpress\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/12\\/checkbox-circle-fill.svg\",\"id\":8080},\"library\":\"svg\"},\"_id\":\"f8ee264\"}],\"widget_title_text\":\"Widget title\",\"gap_between_posts\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":60,\"sizes\":[]},\"rows_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":20,\"sizes\":[]},\"icon_position\":\"center\",\"size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":24,\"sizes\":[]},\"gap_above_description\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":20,\"sizes\":[]},\"__globals__\":{\"description_typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=el_content_1\",\"title_typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=el_content_4\"},\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"description_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"description_typ