{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":35,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"},{\"id\":\"e53d0b5\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\">Za sve koji \\u017eele da zelenilo svog dvori\\u0161ta razbiju novom bojom, ova crvena lepotica bi\\u0107e pravi izvor. Zimzeleni grm prilagodljiv razli\\u010ditim na\\u010dina ugoja. Naj\\u010de\\u0161\\u0107e se mo\\u017ee videti u formi \\u017eive ograda ali nisu ni retke forma drve\\u0107a niskog rasta, kao i lepo oblikovane kalemljene forme.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"left\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"\"},\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"raw_id\":\"el_content_1\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Inter\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":15,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_text_transform\":\"none\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":1.6,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"926170e\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":40,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"},{\"id\":\"3bb1069\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"icon_boxes_items\":[{\"title_text\":\"Sustainable organic production\",\"description_text\":\"\",\"button_text\":\"\",\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/wordpress\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/12\\/checkbox-circle-fill.svg\",\"id\":8080},\"library\":\"svg\"},\"_id\":\"2067ab0\"},{\"title_text\":\"100% vegan product\",\"description_text\":\"\",\"button_text\":\"\",\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/wordpress\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/12\\/checkbox-circle-fill.svg\",\"id\":8080},\"library\":\"svg\"},\"_id\":\"646f623\"},{\"title_text\":\"Premium quality CBD product\",\"description_text\":\"\",\"button_text\":\"\",\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/wordpress\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/12\\/checkbox-circle-fill.svg\",\"id\":8080},\"library\":\"svg\"},\"_id\":\"c1326b0\"},{\"title_text\":\"Clinically tested\",\"description_text\":\"\",\"button_text\":\"\",\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/wordpress\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/12\\/checkbox-circle-fill.svg\",\"id\":8080},\"library\":\"svg\"},\"_id\":\"f8ee264\"}],\"widget_title_text\":\"Widget title\",\"gap_between_posts\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":60,\"sizes\":[]},\"rows_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":20,\"sizes\":[]},\"icon_position\":\"center\",\"size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":24,\"sizes\":[]},\"gap_above_description\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":20,\"sizes\":[]},\"__globals__\":{\"description_typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=el_content_1\",\"title_typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=el_content_4\"},\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"description_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"description_typography_font_family\":\"Inter\",\"description_typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":15,\"sizes\":[]},\"description_typography_text_transform\":\"none\",\"description_typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":1.6,\"sizes\":[]},\"raw_id\":\"el_content_4\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"the7_icon_box_grid_widget\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"e713b16\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"gap\":\"wider\",\"__globals__\":{\"background_color\":\"\"},\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"30\",\"right\":0,\"bottom\":\"30\",\"left\":0,\"isLinked\":false},\"_title\":\"about us\",\"background_image\":{\"url\":\"\",\"id\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"background_position\":\"initial\",\"background_xpos\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":110,\"sizes\":[]},\"background_xpos_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":0,\"sizes\":[]},\"background_xpos_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":0,\"sizes\":[]},\"background_ypos\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":-150,\"sizes\":[]},\"background_repeat\":\"no-repeat\",\"background_size\":\"initial\",\"background_bg_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":500,\"sizes\":[]},\"background_overlay_image\":{\"url\":\"\",\"id\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"background_overlay_position\":\"bottom left\",\"background_overlay_xpos\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":0,\"sizes\":[]},\"background_overlay_xpos_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":0,\"sizes\":[]},\"background_overlay_xpos_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":0,\"sizes\":[]},\"background_overlay_ypos\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":0,\"sizes\":[]},\"background_overlay_ypos_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":0,\"sizes\":[]},\"background_overlay_ypos_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":0,\"sizes\":[]},\"background_overlay_repeat\":\"no-repeat\",\"background_overlay_size\":\"contain\",\"background_overlay_bg_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":400,\"sizes\":[]},\"background_overlay_opacity\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"padding_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true},\"structure\":\"20\",\"reverse_order_mobile\":\"reverse-mobile\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"7f7abc0\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":50,\"_inline_size\":null,\"_inline_size_tablet\":60,\"content_position\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"06d83c8\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Opis\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Allan\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":30,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"c1471ad\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Dosta podse\\u0107a na lovor vi\\u0161nju, zbog na\\u010dina rasta i oblika lista. List joj gladak, sjajan i u odrasloj formi tamno zelene boje. Mladi listovi su jarko crvene boje sve do pune veli\\u010dine odnosno do izlaska novih koji \\u0107e nastaviti sa tom bojom dok \\u0107e prethodnici polako pre\\u0107i u zelenu boju. Mladice neprestano izlaze od ranog prole\\u0107a do kasne jeseni, nekada i tople zime.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"left\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"\"},\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"raw_id\":\"el_content_1\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Inter\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":15,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_text_transform\":\"none\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":1.6,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"b4dbfa0\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":40,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"},{\"id\":\"fd03407\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Veli\\u010dina koju biljka dosti\\u017ee\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Allan\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":30,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"b788777\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\">U zavisnosti od forme u kojoj se gaji, Fotinija mo\\u017ee narasti 2 -4 metra. \\u017diva ograda kontrolisanog rasta (zbog orezivanja) mo\\u017ee zavr\\u0161iti na visini \\u010dak i 3 metra, dok se kod kalemljenih formi, u zavisnosti od du\\u017eine stabla na koji se kalemi, toliko i visina ograni\\u010dava.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"left\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"\"},\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"raw_id\":\"el_content_1\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Inter\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":15,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_text_transform\":\"none\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":1.6,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"3abb090\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":40,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"},{\"id\":\"7516efa\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Pozicija u odnosu na sunce\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Allan\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":30,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"129c870\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Prilagodljiva je vrsta, voli sunce a voli ponekad i da odmori u hladu. Nisu retke situacije gde je pozicionirana u potpunoj senci s tim da je tada usporenog rasta i prore\\u0111enija.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"left\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"\"},\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"raw_id\":\"el_content_1\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Inter\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":15,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_text_transform\":\"none\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":1.6,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"586729d\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":40,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"},{\"id\":\"677f9bf\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Brzina rasta\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Allan\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":30,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"79f2407\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Brzo rastu\\u0107a biljka, uz redovno zalivanje i sistem kap po kap, mo\\u017ee da raste do 0,5 metar godi\\u0161nje. Da bi se postigla puna forma \\u017eive ograde (visine 2 metara) potrebno je od 4-5 godina.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"left\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"\"},\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"raw_id\":\"el_content_1\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Inter\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":15,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_text_transform\":\"none\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":1.6,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"318462e\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":40,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"},{\"id\":\"670df0c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Zalivanje\\/ishrana\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Allan\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":30,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"f67a792\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Voli vodu, ne voli mo\\u010dvarna podru\\u010dja ili mesta gde se zadr\\u017eava voda. Idealan tretman zalivanja je kap po kap. U vreme velikih su\\u0161a, potrebno je \\u010dak i odrasle forme zalivati.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"left\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"\"},\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"raw_id\":\"el_content_1\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Inter\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":15,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_text_transform\":\"none\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":1.6,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"ec4d41c\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":50,\"_inline_size\":null,\"background_image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/the7.io\\/elementor-agency\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/sites\\/75\\/2020\\/09\\/bgslider03.jpg\",\"id\":20},\"background_position\":\"center center\",\"background_size\":\"cover\",\"_inline_size_tablet\":40,\"align\":\"center\",\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"30\",\"isLinked\":false},\"content_position\":\"top\",\"margin_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"d2f2931\",\"elType\":\"widge