",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":35,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"},{\"id\":\"970e748\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\">Pravi primer brzorastu\\u0107e \\u017ebunaste biljke. Vatreni grm ili vatreni trn kako se jo\\u0161 kolokvijalno naziva je zimzeleni grm naj\\u010de\\u0161\\u0107e uzgajan kao \\u017eiva ograda \\u0161to zbog svoje izuzetne dekorativnosti ali i zbog za\\u0161titne od prolaska \\u017eivotinja zahvaljuju\\u0107i trnju koje je pozicionirano ka unutra\\u0161njosti samo \\u017ebuna. Pridev vatreni u nazivu poti\\u010de od ploda u obliku bobica \\u010dija narand\\u017easta boja podse\\u0107a na plamen vatre. \\u010cinjenica da je re\\u010d o vrsti koja se naj\\u010de\\u0161\\u0107e koristi pri ure\\u0111ivanju zelenih povr\\u0161ina u re\\u017eiji Gradskog zelenila Beograd, govori o izuzetnoj otpornoj vrsti spremnoj na gradska zaga\\u0111enja i neredovna zalivanja.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"left\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"\"},\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"raw_id\":\"el_content_1\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Inter\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":15,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_text_transform\":\"none\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":1.6,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"754a7a2\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":40,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"},{\"id\":\"e716a6e\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"icon_boxes_items\":[{\"title_text\":\"Sustainable organic production\",\"description_text\":\"\",\"button_text\":\"\",\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/wordpress\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/12\\/checkbox-circle-fill.svg\",\"id\":8080},\"library\":\"svg\"},\"_id\":\"2067ab0\"},{\"title_text\":\"100% vegan product\",