",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":35,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"},{\"id\":\"970e748\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\">Pravi primer brzorastu\\u0107e \\u017ebunaste biljke. Vatreni grm ili vatreni trn kako se jo\\u0161 kolokvijalno naziva je zimzeleni grm naj\\u010de\\u0161\\u0107e uzgajan kao \\u017eiva ograda \\u0161to zbog svoje izuzetne dekorativnosti ali i zbog za\\u0161titne od prolaska \\u017eivotinja zahvaljuju\\u0107i trnju koje je pozicionirano ka unutra\\u0161njosti samo \\u017ebuna. Pridev vatreni u nazivu poti\\u010de od ploda u obliku bobica \\u010dija narand\\u017easta boja podse\\u0107a na plamen vatre. \\u010cinjenica da je re\\u010d o vrsti koja se naj\\u010de\\u0161\\u0107e koristi pri ure\\u0111ivanju zelenih povr\\u0161ina u re\\u017eiji Gradskog zelenila Beograd, govori o izuzetnoj otpornoj vrsti spremnoj na gradska zaga\\u0111enja i neredovna zalivanja.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"left\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"\"},\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"raw_id\":\"el_content_1\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Inter\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":15,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_text_transform\":\"none\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":1.6,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"754a7a2\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":40,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"},{\"id\":\"e716a6e\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"icon_boxes_items\":[{\"title_text\":\"Sunce\",\"description_text\":\"\",\"button_text\":\"\",\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/wordpress\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/12\\/checkbox-circle-fill.svg\",\"id\":8080},\"library\":\"svg\"},\"_id\":\"2067ab0\"},{\"title_text\":\"Visina biljke 3-4 m\",\"description_text\":\"\",\"button_text\":\"\",\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/wordpress\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/12\\/checkbox-circle-fill.svg\",\"id\":8080},\"library\":\"svg\"},\"_id\":\"646f623\"},{\"title_text\":\"Visina sadnice 10-15 cm\",\"description_text\":\"\",\"button_text\":\"\",\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/wordpress\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/12\\/checkbox-circle-fill.svg\",\"id\":8080},\"library\":\"svg\"},\"_id\":\"c1326b0\"},{\"title_text\":\"Zimzeleno\",\"description_text\":\"\",\"button_text\":\"\",\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/wordpress\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/12\\/checkbox-circle-fill.svg\",\"id\":8080},\"library\":\"svg\"},\"_id\":\"f8ee264\"}],\"widget_title_text\":\"Widget title\",\"gap_between_posts\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":60,\"sizes\":[]},\"rows_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":20,\"sizes\":[]},\"icon_position\":\"center\",\"size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":24,\"sizes\":[]},\"gap_above_description\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":20,\"sizes\":[]},\"__globals__\":{\"description_typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=el_content_1\",\"title_typography_typography\":\"globals\\/typography?id=el_content_4\"},\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"description_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"description_typography_font_family\":\"Inter\",\"description_typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":15,\"sizes\":[]},\"description_typography_text_transform\":\"none\",\"description_typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":1.6,\"sizes\":[]},\"raw_id\":\"el_content_4\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"the7_icon_box_grid_widget\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"bad5bc0\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"gap\":\"wider\",\"__globals__\":{\"background_color\":\"\"},\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"30\",\"right\":0,\"bottom\":\"30\",\"left\":0,\"isLinked\":false},\"_title\":\"about us\",\"background_image\":{\"url\":\"\",\"id\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"background_position\":\"initial\",\"background_xpos\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":110,\"sizes\":[]},\"background_xpos_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":0,\"sizes\":[]},\"background_xpos_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":0,\"sizes\":[]},\"background_ypos\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":-150,\"sizes\":[]},\"background_repeat\":\"no-repeat\",\"background_size\":\"initial\",\"background_bg_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":500,\"sizes\":[]},\"background_overlay_image\":{\"url\":\"\",\"id\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"background_overlay_position\":\"bottom left\",\"background_overlay_xpos\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":0,\"sizes\":[]},\"background_overlay_xpos_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":0,\"sizes\":[]},\"background_overlay_xpos_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":0,\"sizes\":[]},\"background_overlay_ypos\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":0,\"sizes\":[]},\"background_overlay_ypos_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":0,\"sizes\":[]},\"background_overlay_ypos_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":0,\"sizes\":[]},\"background_overlay_repeat\":\"no-repeat\",\"background_overlay_size\":\"contain\",\"background_overlay_bg_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":400,\"sizes\":[]},\"background_overlay_opacity\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"padding_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true},\"structure\":\"20\",\"reverse_order_mobile\":\"reverse-mobile\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"6100c54\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":50,\"_inline_size\":null,\"_inline_size_tablet\":60,\"content_position\":\"top\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"af6da85\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Opis\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Allan\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":30,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"4eb9aff\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\">\\u017dbun \\u010dine listovi veli\\u010dine jednog do 2 cm gusto nare\\u0111anih oko gran\\u010dica, tamno zelene boje. Neretko se u literaturi mo\\u017ee prona\\u0107i da se radi o poluzimzelenoj vrsti, ovakva kvalifikacija poti\\u010de od \\u010dinjenice da \\u0107ete u slu\\u010daju jakih i dugih zima biti u prilici da vidite prore\\u0111enost listova i promenu boje do prljavo \\u017eute. \\u017dbun koji je ovako prezimeo, ve\\u0107 sa prvim lepim danima kraja zime po\\u010de\\u0107e da ozelenjuje. Cveta leti sa sitnim belim cvetovima. S jeseni od cvetova nastaju bobice pre\\u010dnika do 3 mm. Bobice su nare\\u0111ane u grozdovima, najpre su zelene, potom \\u017eute a u poslednjoj fazi narand\\u017easte sve do kraja zime.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"left\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"\"},\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"raw_id\":\"el_content_1\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Inter\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":15,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_text_transform\":\"none\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":1.6,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"4f51467\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":40,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"},{\"id\":\"b2eac73\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Veli\\u010dina koju biljka dosti\\u017ee\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Allan\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":30,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"2512050\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>U zavisnosti od forme, \\u017eiva ograda uz redovno orezivanje (dva puta godi\\u0161nje) mo\\u017ee da dostigne visinu od 3 metra za manje od 5 godina. Sa re\\u0111im orezivanjem i kao samostalna forma mo\\u017ee da naste 3-4 metra za 3-4 godine.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"left\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"\"},\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"raw_id\":\"el_content_1\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Inter\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":15,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_text_transform\":\"none\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":1.6,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"05f91bf\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":40,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"},{\"id\":\"ba050f9\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Pozicija u odnosu na sunce\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Allan\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":30,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"4e9ebf3\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Prilagodljiva je mada najvi\\u0161e voli \\u010disto sunce. Sa jakim sunce i pa\\u017eljivim orezivanje posti\\u017ee se gust raspored bobica tako da i \\u010ditav \\u017ebun mo\\u017ee biti prekriven narand\\u017eastom bojom.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"left\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"\"},\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"raw_id\":\"el_content_1\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Inter\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":15,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_text_transform\":\"none\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":1.6,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"838190c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":40,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"},{\"id\":\"b3c2d81\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Brzina rasta\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Allan\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":30,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"0b2185d\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Brzo rastu\\u0107a biljka, uz redovno zalivanje i sistem kap po kap, mo\\u017ee da raste do 1 metar godi\\u0161nje. Da bi se postigla puna forma \\u017eive ograde (visine 3 metara) potrebno je od 3-4 godine.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"left\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"\"},\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"raw_id\":\"el_content_1\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Inter\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":15,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_text_transform\":\"none\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":1.6,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"176ed7c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":40,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"},{\"id\":\"f74e92a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Zalivanje\\/ishrana\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Allan\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":30,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"a735cc8\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Voli vodu, ne voli mo\\u010dvarna podru\\u010dja ili mesta gde se zadr\\u017eava voda. Idealan tretman zalivanja je kap po kap. U vreme velikih su\\u0161a, potrebno je \\u010dak i odrasle forme zalivati.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"left\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"\"},\"_element_custom_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"raw_id\":\"el_content_1\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Inter\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":15,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_text_transform\":\"none\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":1.6,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"7b13f7e\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":50,\"_inline_size\":null,\"background_image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/the7.io\\/elementor-agency\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/sites\\/75\\/2020\\/09\\/bgslider03.jpg\",\"id\":20},\"background_position\":\"center center\",\"background_size\":\"cover\",\"_inline_size_tablet\":40,\"align\":\"center\",\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"30\",\"isLinked\":false},\"content_position\":\"top\",\"margin_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"bb687cf\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/wordpress\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2022\\/11\\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-03-16-at-21.33.18.jpeg\",\"id\":8425,\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\",\"size\":\"\"},\"image_border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true},\"image_border_radius_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"top\":\"\",\"right\":\"\",\"bottom\":\"\",\"left\":\"\",\"isLinked\":true},\"image_border_radius_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"top\":\"\",\"right\":\"\",\"bottom\":\"\",\"left\":\"\",\"isLinked\":true},\"image_size\":\"custom\",\"image_custom_dimension\":{\"width\":\"900\",\"height\":\"800\"},\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"top\":\"\",\"right\":\"\",\"bottom\":\"\",\"left\":\"\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_margin_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"top\":\"\",\"right\":\"\",\"bottom\":\"\",\"left\":\"\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_margin_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"top\":\"\",\"right\":\"\",\"bottom\":\"\",\"left\":\"\",\"isLinked\":true}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"88e34b4\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":40,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"},{\"id\":\"3462adb\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"