 et tortor euismod, vel maximus metus tristique. Cool!\"j_washington<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"><path fill=\"none\" d=\"M0 0h24v24H0z\"></path><path d=\"M10.828 12l4.95 4.95-1.414 1.414L8 12l6.364-6.364 1.414 1.414z\"></path></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"><path fill=\"none\" d=\"M0 0h24v24H0z\"></path><path d=\"M13.172 12l-4.95-4.95 1.414-1.414L16 12l-6.364 6.364-1.414-1.414z\"></path></svg>				\n															<img width=\"512\" height=\"1024\" src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/plant-157469_1920.png\" alt=\"\" />															\n					<h2>Najpopularnije sadnice</h2>				\n		<p>Naše najtraženije sadnice odlikuju se vrhunskim kvalitetom i prilagođene su različitim uslovima uzgoja.</p>		\n		<article>\n			<figure>\n					<a href=\"http://localhost/wordpress/product/product007/\"><img width=\"960\" height=\"1280\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D&#039;http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg&#039;%20viewBox%3D&#039;0%200%20960%201280&#039;%2F%3E\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" style=\"--ratio: 960 / 1280;\" data-src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/laurel-cherry-115306_1280.jpg\" loading=\"eager\" data-srcset=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/laurel-cherry-115306_1280.jpg 960w, http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/laurel-cherry-115306_1280-225x300.jpg 225w, http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/laurel-cherry-115306_1280-768x1024.jpg 768w\" /><img width=\"960\" height=\"1280\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D&#039;http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg&#039;%20viewBox%3D&#039;0%200%20960%201280&#039;%2F%3E\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" sizes=\"(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px\" style=\"--ratio: 960 / 1280;\" data-src=\"http://localhost/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2022/11/laurel-cherry-55805_1