 0c-.825 0-1.5.675-1.5 1.5s.675 1.5 1.5 1.5 1.5-.675 1.5-1.5-.675-1.5-1.5-1.5z\"></path></svg></a>\n	<h3><a href=\"http://localhost/wordpress/2022/11/05/what-to-look-for-in-quality-cbd-products/\" rel=\"bookmark\" title=\"What to look for in quality CBD products\">What to look for in quality CBD products</a></h3><time datetime=\"2022-11-05T12:16:13+00:00\">November 5, 2022</time><a href=\"http://localhost/wordpress/2022/11/05/what-to-look-for-in-quality-cbd-products/\" target=\"\" aria-label=\"Read more about What to look for in quality CBD products\">Read article</a>\n</article><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"><path fill=\"none\" d=\"M0 0h24v24H0z\"></path><path d=\"M10.828 12l4.95 4.95-1.414 1.414L8 12l6.364-6.364 1.414 1.414z\"></path></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"><path fill=\"none\" d=\"M0 0h24v24H0z\"></path><path d=\"M13.172 12l-4.95-4.95 1.414-1.414L16 12l-6.364 6.364-1.414-1.414z\"></path></svg>				\n					<h3>Imate dodatna pitanja? Kontaktirajte nas!</h3>				\n					<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"><path fill=\"none\" d=\"M0 0h24v24H0z\"></path><path d=\"M22 17.002a6.002 6.002 0 0 1-4.713 5.86l-.638-1.914A4.003 4.003 0 0 0 19.465 19H17a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2.938a8.001 8.001 0 0 0-15.876 0H7a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-5C2 6.477 6.477 2 12 2s10 4.477 10 10V17.002zM20 17v-4h-3v4h3zM4 13v4h3v-4H4z\"></path></svg>				\n		<p>Kontakt</p><p>001 234-567-890</p>		\n					<a href=\"http://localhost/wordpress/contact/\">Kontaktiraj na putem email-a<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"><path fill=\"none\" d=\"M0 0h24v24H0z\"></path><path d=\"M16.172 11l-5.364-5.364 1.414-1.414L20 12l-7.778 7.778-1.414-1.414L16.172 13H4v-2z\"></path></svg></a>				\n					<h2>Add Your Heading Text Here</h2>', 'Home', '', 'inherit',